Convert the remaining services to JSON logging.

Heat, Magnum, Tacker, Trove, Blazar, Mistral, Watcher and Barbican now
honour openstack_logging_json, which is every remaining oslo.log
service Kolla-Ansible deploys.

Trove has a second configuration file for its guest agent. That agent
runs inside the guest rather than on a Kolla host, so Fluentd never
sees its log, but it reads the same template and leaving it on the
text format would make the two disagree for no reason.

Prompt: Michael asked for the bulk conversion to be broken into
batches by project rather than landing as thirty separate commits.
This is the last batch.

